            Natural light, warm materials and simple furniture choices shape this home office. A considered design that balances function and comfort, fitting naturally into everyday living spaces without feeling staged.
        </p>
        <div class="product-hotspot-card hotspot-card-1" hotspot-card="1">
            <div class="product-hotspot-card-inner">
                <div class="card-thumb">
                    <a href="/products/just-right-height-adjustable-desk">
                        <picture>
                            <img src="{{ 'inspired-card-img1.jpg' | file_img_url: '114x' }}" alt="just right height adjustable desk" width="114px" height="109px">
                        </picture>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h4 class="body-tite">Just Right Height Adjustable Desk</h4>
                    <div class="card-dis">
                        <p>Just Right is an electric height adjustable desk offering all day support with custom sizes and colours UX.</p>
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="15px" height="23px" viewBox="0 0 15 23" class="arrow">
                            <path fill-rule="evenodd"  stroke="rgb(228, 233, 238)" stroke-width="2px" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill="none" d="M2.639,1.805 L11.534,10.700 L2.639,19.595 "/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-hotspot-card hotspot-card-2" hotspot-card="2">
            <div class="product-hotspot-card-inner">
                <div class="card-thumb">
                    <a href="/products/lark-swivel-meeting-chair">
                        <picture>
                            <img src="{{ 'lark-swivel-img1.jpg' | file_img_url: '114x' }}" alt="lark swivel meeting chair" width="114px" height="109px">
                        </picture>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h4 class="body-tite">Lark Swivel Chair</h4>
                    <div class="card-dis">
                        <p>Lark is a swivel chair with adjustable height, optional arms and a refined look that fits any home office.</p>
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="15px" height="23px" viewBox="0 0 15 23" class="arrow">
                            <path fill-rule="evenodd"  stroke="rgb(228, 233, 238)" stroke-width="2px" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill="none" d="M2.639,1.805 L11.534,10.700 L2.639,19.595 "/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-hotspot-card hotspot-card-3" hotspot-card="3">
            <div class="product-hotspot-card-inner">
                <div class="card-thumb">
                    <a href="/products/jasonl-monitor-riser-white-birch">
                        <picture>
                            <img src="{{ 'jasonl-monitor-riser.jpg' | file_img_url: '114x' }}" alt="jasonl monitor riser white birch" width="114px" height="109px">
                        </picture>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h4 class="body-tite">JasonL Monitor Riser</h4>
                    <div class="card-dis">
                        <p>Elevate your screen to eye level with a compact ergonomic monitor riser that blends into any desk at home.</p>
